UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text1`='$n, you forgot who I was already? Maybe you should ask the Machine Speakers for a thorough diagnostic!\n\n <Dawn laughs.>\n\nI am Dawn, friend. I oversaw you and many others\' awakening protocols. Some have taken to seeing me as leader of the Awakened. But as leader...\n\nI find myself more at a loss than before. From your journeys you\'ve seemed to have found who you are. Maybe Azeroth calls for me to venture forth to find who I am by exploration as well.\n\nPerhaps I should speak with the Stormward and her new Stormrangers to inquire further. There is much chatter in the city as of late that has gotten their attention...', `VoiceOverPriorityID`=1024, `VerifiedBuild`=58162 WHERE `ID`=276806;
